Package: veloce-core
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: VeloceSolutions <support@velocesolutions.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), systemd (>= 245)
Description: VeloceNetwork Linux Runtime
 VeloceCore is the daemon component of VeloceNetwork for Linux.
 It provides process management with cgroups v2, encrypted secrets via
 XChaCha20-Poly1305, a .vln private DNS namespace, and Noise_IK mesh
 P2P networking between nodes.
